  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5023.01 Electrical System Requirements. All electrical firing systems shall be in accordance with NFPA 1123, Code for Display Fireworks, 2014 edition, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
